  "_note_on_the_twitch_entries": [
    "Several of these are large channels that flag themselves mature. They are",
    "in the seed on purpose: the point of the filter is that it removes them",
    "without anyone having to know in advance which ones they were, and a seed",
    "list where nothing is ever rejected proves nothing."
